menu "ESP32 Vault Configuration"

    config ENABLE_TEST_SEEDER
        bool "Enable Test Seeder"
        default n
        help
            Enable test seeder to generate synthetic telemetry data every second.
            This is useful for validating firmware stability and MQTT connectivity
            without requiring actual signal inputs.
            
            When enabled, the firmware will publish:
            - Raw edge packets with simulated edge changes
            - Pulse width packets with simulated pulse measurements
            - Diagnostic packets with current system state
            
            WARNING: This should only be enabled for testing purposes.
            Do not enable in production builds.

endmenu
